If `FileProxy` implements `isatty`, then `getattr(self.file, "isatty", None)` will return `FileProxy.isatty`. Then `isatty()` is called.

If `self.__file` doesn't have `isatty`, `FileProxy.isatty()` will return `False`.

This is exactly what we want.

